# ramvamp ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** Rust CPU-first runtime executing quantized MoE models through NVMe expert streaming.

**LEONES status:** active source; priority candidate; ODS benchmark pending.

## Executive summary

ramvamp is particularly relevant to ODS because it does not depend on a large GPU. Common weights are memory-mapped while experts are stored in a dedicated format and loaded from NVMe with io_uring/O_DIRECT and a per-layer LFU cache.

The project currently targets Qwen3-30B-A3B and provides an OpenAI-compatible server with chat completions and streaming.

## ODS fit

ramvamp is an excellent candidate for the CPU/NVMe strategy and complements CUDA-oriented MoE runtimes.

**Classification:** P1 CPU/NVMe MoE candidate.